#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "يستخدمه Native Share و WhatsApp والبريد الإلكتروني و Telegram و X و Bluesky و Threads و Reddit. يقرأ Facebook و LinkedIn العنوان من الصفحة البيانات الوصفية Open Graph."

#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Message text (optional)"
msgstr "نص الرسالة (اختياري)"

#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, and Threads. Facebook and LinkedIn do not accept a custom message; Reddit uses only the title and URL."
msgstr "يستخدمه Native Share و WhatsApp والبريد الإلكتروني و Telegram و X و Bluesky و Threads. لا يقبل Facebook و LinkedIn رسالة مخصصة ؛ يستخدم Reddit العنوان وعنوان URL فقط."

